% Shared bibliography for all subprojects in this repository.
%
% Convention (see e.g. project_proposal/citation_macros.tex): enrich each
% entry with `citations` and `citationsource` fields recording a verified
% citation count and where/when it was checked, so inline citations can
% show "(Year, Venue, N citations)" without re-deriving it each time.
% Never estimate or guess a citation count -- verify it (e.g. via OpenAlex
% or Semantic Scholar) before recording it.
%
% Note: BibTeX ignores percent signs inside entries and instead scans the
% whole file for the entry-type marker to find where the next entry
% starts, so keep any example or template entries out of this file
% entirely (e.g. in a README) rather than commenting them out here.
